#: scenario8:scenario8_4D5B1952_FBB7_450D_B213_2EECB2E8B062
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0889ea926b11584a8cb0a64e718baa7904050910c5654068b61dcecc4052cdc
#. default-sha256: eb0d4e1d6b30f442d511501c65528b6bf24b4c6b7b0f12197cfcb665dbb69c60
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4D5B1952_FBB7_450D_B213_2EECB2E8B062"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I remember the Silk Road,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫stretching out before me as far as the eye can see,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫기억하는 건 끝도 없이 이어진 실크로드……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E99D19E3_A167_4F57_A7DA_8791B0F2861E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23b2a72667d3250c58cdb4f194fd1764e8725a955961011afb62f718c4a27d9c
#. default-sha256: 723389b9560cdb90896a30b95df42399ee164d634403ba2979cc220ff999e743
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E99D19E3_A167_4F57_A7DA_8791B0F2861E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫clouds of dust wisping across the bare dirt trail."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫모래먼지가 휘날리는 비포장 흙길."

#: scenario8:scenario8_40E7908F_A47F_49C9_A203_5A99E5B51E79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a97ab7a915c12e98a18b1e908333cba501e2062fabbd9c1ca2fdcfef99c7ad36
#. default-sha256: 42ee10146f7e77949f1a361c0a2fa46560ee09f7637e942efba5374ec39b6dd9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_40E7908F_A47F_49C9_A203_5A99E5B51E79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But beyond that,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫나는……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A4526673_F606_486A_B4A8_F455E5DA6B49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9db4ecad719cac70742014bbd7b4a837f0f357632a05e5036951270d56f8d301
#. default-sha256: 9bc48d3797587ddf534885c7ae5cb26fc1c78f115a25d870c04d493f2eedd506
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A4526673_F606_486A_B4A8_F455E5DA6B49"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I can only clearly remember the last five years or so of my life.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫In my oldest "
"real memory, I was a slave."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫뚜렷하게 기억이 나는 건 ⟪k:2⟫약 5년 전부터다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫나는 노예였다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7A6735AE_C1A9_4B70_B191_D290FCD9996A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f9d2fd9d2b705b323c2cd6abf56a5daad92ad6d9f43b1b1c753e85ae694a252
#. default-sha256: 31f7c13a5458ceb376ec029fe4626b9f7297bfab7d19f2b59c019b4d9fc392b4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7A6735AE_C1A9_4B70_B191_D290FCD9996A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You have no idea what that’s like.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How it feels to be abused and humiliated,⟪k:3⟫"
"desperate for food and water."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫너는 모르겠다만. ⟪k:1⟫타인에게 핍박당하는 굴욕과 그때 느낀 굶주림을……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B462978E_C7DD_4FDE_A8A9_8D469051BEB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8fd9accf9bb96b0173fc2ed93cdd40647e98deb987d5d4dcc1a193bed8b7d24
#. default-sha256: 1a1e51ba5824cb6c0ed95a3efb6fac3d5d7ab5538323d4055c5d56c963c80b24
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B462978E_C7DD_4FDE_A8A9_8D469051BEB8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh... ⟪k:1⟫I see.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So as I was saying..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아니…… 그래. ⟪k:1⟫마저…… 이야기하지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5D6BA232_6825_4A00_A986_8F8C0BFDBBE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1bc892f2126f7357182c4d00de7630e7fdb28de659a66335ba65c876dfeb573d
#. default-sha256: 0cce05db6049245bca2f333eacdf6bedc3b51c0d95ffcfedcc7fb13c386e4b8c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5D6BA232_6825_4A00_A986_8F8C0BFDBBE4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But they were right about what I was deep down—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a beast—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and my revenge "
"went far beyond what could be considered reasonable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만…… 내 본질은 ⟪k:1⟫처음부터 짐승이었을 테지…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫나는 ⟪k:4⟫그 당연한 복수보다 더"
"한 짓을 했거든."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F9F2E4D1_B033_4ECD_A2BC_3268A2155534
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf2ea4d899dfd3283c4c45d1d7c320d18cfc578c99583c98429f6cb238944494
#. default-sha256: 89dffb4afc09bfffbf1875026eb0b6243bba91ae8a627aba5dc81b831079985b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F9F2E4D1_B033_4ECD_A2BC_3268A2155534"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Four years ago,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫4년 전 일이다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9737F342_11CF_4BCE_8FD4_F42B0B6D45AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6c655d5ac095c1ea0bfcc7fbb0f178633816ff2e61edbee12fa94db66dca94d
#. default-sha256: a78fcc802e3ab1abac109344dd01552e8b0490d75797763740b2ec6be14a33f3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9737F342_11CF_4BCE_8FD4_F42B0B6D45AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was sitting in a carriage as it rattled along a dirt road. ⟪k:1⟫This was not the kind of "
"carriage you rode around town in, but a filthy slave transport."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 날, ⟪k:1⟫나는 마차에 실려 있었다. ⟪k:2⟫여행용 마차가 아니다, ⟪k:3⟫더러운 노예 운반용 마차"
"였지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0D1D9CD2_9C53_41BC_B3F0_18430F2CAD00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f6960a854d97322e563bdebcb4321662dcf140ed9612fe240881d49fd478ded
#. default-sha256: 804ec4c17f8941f7535bedb1d1c53c53f3a94a5e2c8e5b3c2f0741eeed826e3b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0D1D9CD2_9C53_41BC_B3F0_18430F2CAD00"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There were men, young women, and even children.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Everyone wore a look of "
"hopelessness on their faces,⟪k:3⟫and no one had the strength left to resist."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫젊은 여자도 있거니와, ⟪k:1⟫아이도 있었다. ⟪k:2⟫모두 ⟪k:3⟫절망에 찬 표정이더군. ⟪k:4⟫하지만 저"
"항할 여력도 없었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1D886E58_66E2_49FB_9D60_309E65564CB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f53ee0ef8ae1a1ed612c8185e9557d72efb8e063500f0b4c2b762740ae918e9
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1D886E58_66E2_49FB_9D60_309E65564CB9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario8:scenario8_260F0301_C684_4150_A887_524181C4FBA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4f9f9acb08a5da4c4cbe551ba1213d134ecdd0d3095e9bfb1c201da91f9fc4e
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_260F0301_C684_4150_A887_524181C4FBA5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9BDA91B8_539C_4F5D_847A_7DA133F4322E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fcf0dc836858871ac19460df28c6e15604984f134735f940007e1b80552dd9d7
#. default-sha256: 0d70b479d7a877ec70c87f199665c83d30953b3555c41197019c90bc9c636cb1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9BDA91B8_539C_4F5D_847A_7DA133F4322E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her response perplexed me to no end."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……솔직히 ⟪k:1⟫신기하기 그지없었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EC49C8BB_5FDB_4AE8_9EBB_AA9063A1CF4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b93fc6378a393e57d220e2352c8a96854805830fdcaa4bb7d2c9d5cab82d09f5
#. default-sha256: 413b60bae8cca74db3556f426aea386f86929a7e44784a932177537dabe0144b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EC49C8BB_5FDB_4AE8_9EBB_AA9063A1CF4E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why was she concerned about showing gratitude?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why was she not despairing of her "
"own circumstances?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫왜 지금 ⟪k:1⟫타인에 대한 감사란 말이 나오지?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫왜 본인의 처지를 한탄하지 않지?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_588F204E_BD55_492F_AE46_FEE88E4B0992
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8241f360c4c4441a2102b89575cb3a08cb4942df828e39bc204032a8a5a11d42
#. default-sha256: f6d535bb1a65d10fdee521cd615759fa8f3760f026c78f2461d4b2bbb17d91d8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_588F204E_BD55_492F_AE46_FEE88E4B0992"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why was ⟪k:1⟫that⟪k:2⟫ the emotion that gripped her in that moment,⟪k:3⟫not hatred for the "
"slave trader or sorrow for herself?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫노예상인을 증오하지도 않고, ⟪k:1⟫본인을 처량해하는 것도 아니라…… ⟪k:2⟫왜 감사를 못 전한 점에 "
"울지?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E741F2EC_7327_47BE_A7F8_6829F55F4BD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a1cba3085d4f2358c459003b23ea7efa7f4f98a929b49becf50f6d0dd1bdce2
#. default-sha256: ab322399edc35d33c1d019678ade1329a5bbcbc7649edbd2b8c467ea02a92948
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E741F2EC_7327_47BE_A7F8_6829F55F4BD7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But that wasn’t the only thing I found curious—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……신기하던 건 ⟪k:1⟫그 소녀의 말 뿐만 아니라…… 목소리도 그랬다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5208504F_1AAE_4F72_B6CB_E7190415914C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be05a1d1fd7366d5dd225710c059e721048d638b3c3fd8adae5fb33378e5b346
#. default-sha256: 1e4b6a39a2b493879982d30811a42c9d4eb0728dd5b89aa4a5dd5cb0e04aa8d0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5208504F_1AAE_4F72_B6CB_E7190415914C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫untainted by its surroundings, gently undulating."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그게 무엇하고도 섞이지 않고, ⟪k:1⟫침식되지 않으며 ⟪k:2⟫천천히 찰랑거렸다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E504084A_9C20_45F3_912C_A7D0B10F5E4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f37cf39f9b65900b5a49dc8a4b0d50b977c841355197a58e38a3f9b5b354b3b
#. default-sha256: 08cf9dbef98e6739ea69dc199cada21030d1cc8bfaa946e235ada8c10f71ae20
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E504084A_9C20_45F3_912C_A7D0B10F5E4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One sentence was all she said, but there was something unbelievably calming about the sound "
"of it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소녀가 한 말은 그게 다였지만, ⟪k:1⟫그건 놀라우리만치 내 마음을 편안하게 했다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B8A4CC39_B636_4246_8280_80E8593A0BC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e7a4a72dc4bb0a5fd5a0533036910e631f3830f11f6a8dd0d5068d13d5eb50b
#. default-sha256: 016814e4fb8d323675ba79cc045457a1f5c1fab0d8d06756a95f880ad1ab73ab
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B8A4CC39_B636_4246_8280_80E8593A0BC9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wanted to get her out of that filthy carriage,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫to undo the shackles threatening "
"to taint her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 녀석을…… 이 더러운 마차에서 내보내 주자……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그 더러운 수갑을 풀어 주자……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A6C67B8C_AC73_47DE_B7BA_2A35F735CC4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4498026a57c320c18c3aaa1804e5e156a519298ffc329f49b6e231a3a6dc7736
#. default-sha256: a4a940a573aa13cde6eb7f8e5db3f514a34f5ffdd6e27ef95d359bc52c4abc3a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A6C67B8C_AC73_47DE_B7BA_2A35F735CC4D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please! Y-⟪k:1⟫You can have all my money!⟪k:2⟫You can go free, if that’s what you want!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제발……! ⟪k:1⟫도, ⟪k:2⟫돈이라면 주마……! ⟪k:3⟫네 자유도 주마!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E9304167_6DA8_4048_B3A9_C40F51B84193
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4f9f9acb08a5da4c4cbe551ba1213d134ecdd0d3095e9bfb1c201da91f9fc4e
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E9304167_6DA8_4048_B3A9_C40F51B84193"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7DBA9456_045C_4B81_80D9_855C84B146AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1243af929d258fa95fce869adbd1368b7db7463ac24532cc3bae1bcc4c36f8a
#. default-sha256: 52b1239cf52e60a3eb34842793da2edfbddcbb6f7da0a21ee259d4f150a377fe
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7DBA9456_045C_4B81_80D9_855C84B146AD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What... ⟪k:1⟫Why are you laughing?!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Please spare me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이봐…… ⟪k:1⟫너, ⟪k:2⟫왜 웃는데……!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫제발 ⟪k:5⟫넘어가 줘……!!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_356BBD69_CC39_40EF_B716_3DC3E83C717F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9cda3fe210dcc8002d83449135cc6329033f9c578f114cc5162c90733aa9ddb6
#. default-sha256: b1a60e60843012a2a54856c898a2a535f4faa73c2f7b97f17ed968bf2bb4ba7b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_356BBD69_CC39_40EF_B716_3DC3E83C717F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And why—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫                                             ⟪k:7⟫"
"should I care?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그게 뭐―――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　　　　　　　　어쨌는데?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_47E25499_1CB1_4FCD_812C_5E2E7E83CFEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83afe9e8c898d9df6bd9fd077eb2010346bcd3110ce849942a08cf0c3db54d6b
#. default-sha256: f514c91b156f9b060cb7dc20a6d1c8c0f968076c51117749d01c24fca62534a9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_47E25499_1CB1_4FCD_812C_5E2E7E83CFEF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Look at this..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이봐……, ⟪k:1⟫잘 봐………."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7A46B2FE_18AB_4BAF_89BD_43662D335722
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22aed4d8de4d2b200fde32d3128a902e07c2ab0a659d9190a77533c2a5f205e4
#. default-sha256: 51dc60178b4d38ca1ae567582619ae5e68c241a8b0d8db2d2e210c55e86f4cd1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7A46B2FE_18AB_4BAF_89BD_43662D335722"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They stood no chance against my strength!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 힘에…… ⟪k:1⟫놈들은 굴복할 수밖에 없었어……!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B7204B16_FEB5_4ED8_9B3C_52F11A5F5D88
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 263989fb33fe70da5cf967977cb6bae6f1b6f5f05acd5405869dfa294872b5b9
#. default-sha256: 92ba5535cedf19d746fedcbd2d8fb72157447c1c3274ba6fa2ce6e539f4e9a48
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B7204B16_FEB5_4ED8_9B3C_52F11A5F5D88"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫After taking the keys off one of the slave traders, I returned to the carriage, "
"doing my best to act calm and suppress the bubbling exhilaration."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……나는 노예상인의 열쇠를 챙겨 ⟪k:3⟫마차로 돌아왔다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫솟구치는 흥분을 가까스"
"로 억누르며 ⟪k:6⟫태연한 척했지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_22D704DB_3077_46C5_B94C_2FE52D04285E
