msgid "⟪k:0⟫Say something, would you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……왜 아무 말도 안 하지……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_31884E56_35E7_461B_AB90_FD56C9E78DD3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05a31c5951f7c1856ca74538deb6d2200d311c09d8434717abd83b016b2b4c1c
