msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In time, though, the slaves started cheering.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The same people who had been wailing "
"minutes earlier were now shouting praises."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫머지않아…… ⟪k:1⟫노예들이 찬사를 했다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫아까까지 본인 처지를 한탄한 것들이―― 환희를 내"
"비친 거다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CBD04A9A_7B75_4FE0_980B_B2D7D060FB41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcd18ec9b579b634415f7a66803dbfa6c592aabff1b2f26a2a5bf22461d6431a
