msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_83881989_C7C0_471C_ACBE_BAD3493E5052"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Their cries for mercy as I ripped through them were delicious."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내게 싹싹 빌다 죽는 자의 목소리가 ⟪k:1⟫기분 좋았다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4D703E66_E469_41D1_9B06_5B1554A586F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3429a1d12f963aee0a8d700eda160769213b114408a647cea4b3c2391123a98a
#. default-sha256: 18f3027414231cdeb483847c47f26c54327391bec6012ed20de9845d1b4ef931
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4D703E66_E469_41D1_9B06_5B1554A586F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I didn’t care anymore that they were just as much victims as me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That they had "
"suffered the same abuse and humiliation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 녀석들이 나처럼 핍박받은 자든……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫피해자든 뭐든…… ⟪k:3⟫그딴 건…… 아무래도 좋았다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_668C0414_917B_4B95_8543_254F4F1764EE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a54d6815c490f59b2838b05f770089eacaeb1cc0c7f5215f67fda17394b7d9a
