msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8D4B1283_A266_48EB_81E1_BBEC1E1C1B3D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Was unleashing my innate savagery and reveling in the massacre of helpless people really all "
"I wanted?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내 폭력성을 자각하여 ⟪k:1⟫살육의 유열에 빠지긴 했지만――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내가 진정으로 원한 게 그게 "
"다였을지……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_EC02A3DD_AD91_439C_B0BF_8C3021A8F3F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f530484cb923ac69ac7cbd88e69088db0b7345b4cd1f07d60c9809ddaee82f9
#. default-sha256: 52915681ce62b6723b4817c142569c007334bdbdd71aba092bd73ab7f30ec21e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EC02A3DD_AD91_439C_B0BF_8C3021A8F3F5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had no hope of anyone taking me in—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫not only was I a murderer, I was a "
"foreigner."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내가 정착할 터전은 ⟪k:1⟫당연히 있지도 않았다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫나는 살인자인 데다―― 이국 인간이잖나."

#: scenario8:scenario8_79E140B8_0FC7_4041_9AF8_2651829A1694
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49761385d95923ba0a08165798e149a184150d2523e62f78bbac81a08edb3371
