msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5037EDDB_CAFB_4F0B_B178_215016F9CE6B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫One day, I woke up with the chills, my vision blurry, barely able to move my own limbs."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어느 날 갑자기 ⟪k:1⟫오한이 멎질 않더니――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫시야가 흐려져서 ⟪k:4⟫움직이기도 힘들어졌다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_ACC92DF9_756F_4719_A18B_AE6DBA4CFC70
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93ffe0e0632d2f427e5c2cec22280e2d6f094c36a037d9ba67c8afa19179e4d3
