msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_ACC92DF9_756F_4719_A18B_AE6DBA4CFC70"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was a moderately busy road, at that, so I assume I had made it close to the city."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫도시와 가까운 위치에 쓰러져서 ⟪k:1⟫사람이 오가긴 했다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫도시로 가는 인간이 내 옆에서 "
"멈칫하다가――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_88A62996_2911_496C_B786_3B60A5428774
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4fbd2655724e86c654697f0277436aa516987c68d7b856ad6eb24ab4c317c68
