msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I didn’t look like someone a respectable person would want to involve themselves with in "
"normal circumstances, so it was no surprise they weren’t interested in this sick, filthy foreign "
"man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아무도 나와 엮이려 하질 않은 거다. ⟪k:1⟫뭐…… 당연한 바지. ⟪k:2⟫누가 봐도 일반인으론 안 보일 "
"테니."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E1FD553C_57A9_4A3C_85CC_ED6C8901D623
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0133e6ba648a9e901c2e101e59a9063950b32e8148f04077a697e9fd68d7d968
