msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I didn’t lament my impending demise.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I accepted that such was the way of the world."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫죽음에 ⟪k:1⟫슬픔을 느끼진 않았다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫이런 법이겠단 ⟪k:4⟫달관만을 느꼈다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1D23F1D7_A5B0_4AD6_B27E_36588A8D0532
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2689b04762cec463fdfbb2a32b359469c8862b3f5c73ab227ff91f4bf303a3dd
