msgid "⟪k:0⟫But then,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런데…… ⟪k:1⟫바로 그때였다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_55086CF6_3D9E_4865_BBCD_81C12B8E833A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f7e8b1afbd093a2866ef1307bb6f4904191264d239a06e17ae1dc141b03d196
