msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I glanced up to see a woman in a nun’s habit looking down on me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫한 수도녀가…… ⟪k:3⟫내게 다가온 것이다."

