"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You can rest up in one of the open beds,⟪k:2⟫and I should be able to get you a little "
"something to eat..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫침대도 있으니 ⟪k:2⟫거기서 쉬자. ⟪k:3⟫또, 뭐라도 ⟪k:4⟫먹을 거나 영양가 있는 걸 조금은 줄 "
"수 있을걸……."

